Firmware for 'make check-seg-temp' and 'make check-new-temp' (with configs/seg_hw.patch for the
first): temperature sensing on D3, a free pin on every board (below 14, as the firmware requires;
not D2/D10-D13, for RF builds). No DS18B20 is simulated: with no device on the bus, every
reset and every bit written still keeps interrupts off for its 1-Wire time slot (up to ~70 us),
which is what these builds measure against the ADC interrupt's deadline.

  PVR_SIM_BUILD=1 sh sim/configs/sim_config.sh NEW
  sed -n '/^diff --git/,$p' sim/configs/temperature.patch | patch -p1    # or git apply --unidiff-zero
  PLATFORMIO_BUILD_DIR=.pio/build-new-temp pio run --project-dir Mk2_1phase_RFdatalog_temp -e basic

